Modifications (AGPL section 5a)
-------------------------------
All changes since the fork point are recorded in the git history of this
repository. The main ones (2026-10):

  - Test suite made runnable without Redis and PostgreSQL; failing tests fixed
  - SQL migration runner fixed (CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY, statistics table)
  - Fixes for upstream issues #44, #45 and #46
  - Security updates of dependencies
  - Web based setup assistant, runtime settings stored in the database
  - Passwords hashed with Argon2id; two-factor login (TOTP, recovery codes)
  - Rebranding to "InterCat Lynx", new logo

